{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape your fears, fear the shapes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The official soundtrack to GYLT, composed by <strong>Cris Velasco</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Sally's Lullaby 03:05\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Emily is Missing 02:43\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Lost in the Woods 02:17\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Entering Bethelwood 01:44</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. What Is This Place? 02:46\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Violence 01:17\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7. Stay Hidden! 02:09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8. All Alone 02:05</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9. Fear 02:16</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10. Exposure 03:42</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11. The Key to Ending this Nightmare 03:42\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12. You're Just Another Monster 01:50</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13. This Isn't Your Home 02:33</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14. Everything's Going to Be OK? 01:28</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15. This Is What You Wanted 01:32</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16. You Know What You Have to Do 01:54</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17. Descent into the Mines 03:27</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18. Helplessness Chase 01:24</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >19. Make Your Choice 02:34</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20. Do You Have a Ticket? 03:47 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;GYLT (Original Game Soundtrack)&quot; was made possible by the following individuals: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cris Velasco: Composer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capellen Orchestra: Recorded at</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daniel Kresco: Mixing Engineer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >David Feldstein: Vocal Engineer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erin Collins: Score Supervisor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lilly Grace Forn: Vocals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jett Galindo: Mastering Engineer (The Bakery)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jos\u00e9 Varon: Additional Orchestration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Louie Schultz: Music Editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nomi Abadi: Vocal Producer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Petr Pololanik: Conductor, Orchestrator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rozen: Album art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sebastian Wolff: Executive Producer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tania Valle: Score Coordinator</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2484210?t=1771943407","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484210/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771943407","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484210/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771943407","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484210/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771943407","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape your fears, fear the shapes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The official soundtrack to GYLT, composed by <strong>Cris Velasco</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Sally's Lullaby 03:05\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Emily is Missing 02:43\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Lost in the Woods 02:17\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Entering Bethelwood 01:44</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. What Is This Place? 02:46\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Violence 01:17\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7. Stay Hidden! 02:09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8. All Alone 02:05</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9. Fear 02:16</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10. Exposure 03:42</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11. The Key to Ending this Nightmare 03:42\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12. You're Just Another Monster 01:50</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13. This Isn't Your Home 02:33</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14.